# How to Translate Shopify Admin

Shopify Admin is where merchants manage products, orders, customers, settings, and apps.

If you prefer working in another language, you may want to translate Shopify Admin directly in your browser.

Page Translate is a Chrome extension that can translate Shopify Admin pages while you work.

## Why translate Shopify Admin?

A merchant may use Shopify in a different language because:

- Their team speaks another language
- They manage stores for international clients
- They are more comfortable working in their native language
- Shopify apps or documentation use another language

A browser translator can help reduce the amount of manual translation required.

## How to translate Shopify Admin

### 1. Install Page Translate

Install Page Translate from the Chrome Web Store.

**[Install Page Translate](CHROME_WEB_STORE_URL)**

### 2. Open Shopify Admin

Log in to your Shopify store normally.

### 3. Open the page you need

You can navigate to products, orders, customers, settings, apps, and other areas.

### 4. Translate the page

Open Page Translate and select your target language.

The extension translates the page directly in Chrome.

## Translate Shopify Admin apps

Shopify Admin can also contain third-party applications.

These apps can have their own interface and language support.

Page Translate is designed to translate web content while you use these apps.

## Translate selected text

If you only need to understand one part of Shopify Admin, you can select the text and translate it instead of translating the whole page.

## Use Shopify Admin in your preferred language

Page Translate is useful when your preferred language isn't available everywhere in the Shopify interface or in the third-party apps you use.

